  "question": {
    "text": "A ray of light is incident at the glass-water interface at an angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math>. If it finally&nbsp;emerges&nbsp;parallel to the surface of the water, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mtext>g</mtext></msub></math>&nbsp;would be<br />\r&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0036_7f7cf5b0afe2.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 153px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mn>4</mn> <mn>3</mn> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mrow>  <mn>1</mn></mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Applying, Snell's law <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>μsin</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>&nbsp;constant&nbsp;</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>, we have<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0036_1ca295005ee1.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 199px;\" /><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>μ</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>sin i</mtext> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <msub> <mi>μ</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>sin i</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Here,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi>glass</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;∴&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mtext>air</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>°</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;∴&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></msub><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>90</mn><mo>°</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴ &nbsp;&nbsp;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mtext>g</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
